phasekit-iapws: notices
=======================

phasekit-iapws is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 (the repository's LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE). It implements
formulations of the International Association for the Properties of Water and Steam, and its coefficient tables are
taken from the IAPWS releases that publish them, each named at the table:

- IAPWS R7-97(2012), Revised Release on the IAPWS Industrial Formulation 1997 for the Thermodynamic Properties of
  Water and Steam: regions 1, 2 and 4 (src/if97/).

Each release states: "Publication in whole or in part is allowed in all countries provided that attribution is given
to the International Association for the Properties of Water and Steam." This notice and the citation at each table
are that attribution. The releases are at https://iapws.org.
